EF AI Workspace (#160, ADR-0016): the Environment Fund brand on the admin panel (owner decision 2026-10-23). The panel
stays in English. The brand files (Aktiv Grotesk 400/600/700, the horizontal logos, the app icon, the favicon) are
copied unaltered from infrastructure/common/client/brand into public/ef by admin-panel.Dockerfile.

- src/ef-brand.css: Aktiv Grotesk, also under the name "Inter" that Click UI 0.9.1 writes into its typography
  variables; Click UI's theme variables in EF colours for both themes (generated from Click UI 0.9.1, rules in the
  file). Imported by src/styles.css, whose own --cui-* accent, link and outline colours follow the same palette.
- Sidebar: the EF app icon instead of the LibreChat mark. Login card: the horizontal logo above the title (blue on
  light, white on dark). Page title "Baseer Admin Panel" and the EF favicon. Logo alt text "Environment Fund".
