+ * (400, 600, 700; 500 renders as 400, #118). Click UI 0.9.1 writes "Inter" into each of its typography variables, so
+ * the same files are also declared under that name: every Click UI text and the panel's own use Aktiv.
+ *
+ * Colours (visual identity guide v01, p22-24): Click UI's own theme variables, overridden per theme with selectors
+ * more specific than Click UI's (it sets data-cui-theme on <html>). Generated from Click UI 0.9.1's variables:
+ * - light: primary buttons #2c3a82 (hover and pressed #1e285f), the near-black accent (#151515) and checked controls
+ *   #2c3a82, links and focus outlines (#437eef) #0051b1;
+ * - dark: the ClickHouse yellow becomes the palette's light blues (#9ca6e0; lighter shades #c3c9ec, #eaecf8).
+ * Charts and warnings keep Click UI's colours. Regenerate on a Click UI upgrade.
+ */
